✅ Class Diagram

Classes & Relationships:
1. Customer
Attributes: name, list of products
Methods: addProduct(), getProducts(), getName()

2. Product
Attributes: name, quantity, pricePerUnit
Methods: getName(), getQuantity(), getPricePerUnit(), getTotalPrice()

3. BillGenerator
Methods: generateBill(Customer), printBill(Customer)

Relationships:
Customer → Product : Composition (a customer owns purchased products).
BillGenerator → Customer : Uses relationship (association).


